   "reasoning": "Level l>0 slots are [Ancestor(l), None, ExternalContent(l)], so slot order tests the ancestor before externalContent; level 0 slots [Own, Content] already match Role order. The order only changes a verdict when a vertex is outside BOTH the ancestor and the externalContent volume at the same level. No fixture does that: external-content-volume-excludes is outside only the shrunk content volume (its tile volume still contains the vertex), and each ~ulp-L*-ancestor / ~ulp-L*-externalContent variant shrinks only one volume. The unit test validate::containment::tests::volumes_are_tested_in_role_order does fail on this patch.",
